  "content": "\n\n<p>這是 VEINMINER<br>想像你正在開採一條 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>龐大</strong> </span>的煤礦脈，這需要 <strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">永遠</span></strong>的時間……對吧？&nbsp;</p>\n<p>不過現在不一樣了</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#236fa1\"><strong>運作方式</strong></span>&nbsp;<br>只需敲擊 <strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">單一</span> </strong>方塊，整條礦脈就會 <strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">全部破碎&nbsp;</span></strong><br>總之，盡情享受吧</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/vayBGB2hwb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/vayBGB2hwb</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>感謝&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>@sketchisbeingfr 進行更新，歡迎去關注他，他是一位很讚的模組創作者</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如需協助請前往 Discord</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>宣傳影片 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=ZyMnBu0BlKnMcDdU&v=JUzI_5JR87I&feature=youtu.be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=ZyMnBu0BlKnMcDdU&amp;amp;v=JUzI_5JR87I&amp;amp;feature=youtu.be</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>我的頻道 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Jupkke\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jupkke - YouTube</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
